  "description": "Our lightweight aluminum Vybe D7 gets you moving with a retro design and 7 speeds of SHIMANO gear range. This crowd-pleasing folding bike promises convenience and true riding comfort，with all the compact folding features that today's busy people have come to expect. The DELTEC cable boosts frame strength and stiffness for safety and efficient pedaling even against big-wheelers.\n\nPowered by DAHON-V\n\nFeaturing DELTECH—key patents of DAHON-V technology—Vybe D7 offers superior frame rigidity for outstanding speed and safety. This powerful synergy enhances pedaling efficiency, making even uphill rides a breeze.\n\nSmooth Riding Experience\n\nEquipped with 7-speed gearing, the Vybe D7 delivers a smooth and adaptable ride, allowing you to tackle hills and varying terrains with ease.\n\nBuilt to Last\n\nCrafted with a durable aluminum frame, the Vybe D7 is both lightweight and strong, providing reliability for daily use and adventures.\n\nVYBE: Embrace the Urban Spirit\n\n\"VYBE\" captures the vibrant spirit of urban exploration, reflecting DAHON's commitment to adventure and modern design.\n\nEasy to Customize\n\nWith versatile accessories available, the Vybe D7 can be tailored to fit your needs, whether for daily commuting or weekend escapades.\n\nSmooth Riding Experience\n\nThis crowd-pleasing folding bike promises convenience and true riding comfort.\n\nQuick-Fold Convenience\n\nWith a simple foldable mechanism, the Vybe D7 collapses for easy transport and storage, making it ideal for commuters and urban adventurers alike.",
